 play.","date":"2018-04-19","published":"2018-04-19T21:48:38+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/toolness/status/987052838030381058","tags":[],"access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published"}
{"id":"known:ec63aff4a473605f2d6480ce9dd3fbbe","url":"/archive/known/?id=ec63aff4a473605f2d6480ce9dd3fbbe","source":"known","type":"replies","title":"@cathieleblanc #indieweb stuff is getting really cool. Try the plug-ins on your blog. Trying out other tools micro.blog and thinking about all these n","summary":"@cathieleblanc #indieweb stuff is getting really cool. Try the plug-ins on your blog. Trying out other tools micro.blog and thinking about all these new readers and what the reader/headless lms would look like. Ton of cool writing and now reading solutions emerging. No video or videochat solution that I see as viable yet. That will always be key tool in lear","date":"2018-04-19","published":"2018-04-19T20:32:21+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/cathieleblanc/status/987056958581682177","tags":["OER","highered","indieweb","oer"],"access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published"}
