{"id":"known:c18bf78c8811459524a133ecea5a01c8","url":"/archive/known/?id=c18bf78c8811459524a133ecea5a01c8","source":"known","type":"replies","title":"@actualham and @cathieleblanc This discussion actually started as I am trying to think about the easiest way to make my workflow around my #oer materi","summary":"@actualham and @cathieleblanc This discussion actually started as I am trying to think about the easiest way to make my workflow around my #oer materials while also building in the metadata to make it both more remixable and trackable across the web for others to use. I am at the limits of my knowledge so it's a fun place to be.","date":"2018-04-19","published":"2018-04-19T16:19:15+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"http://quickthoughts.jgregorymcverry.com/2018/04/19/actualham-cathieleblanc-you-know-any-friend-of-yours-is-a","tags":["oer"],"access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published"}
