{"id":"known:56cf40b13aa446bf0c08bfdc687089cd","url":"/archive/known/?id=56cf40b13aa446bf0c08bfdc687089cd","source":"known","type":"notes","title":"I didn't expect #flyers to go deep this year. I hope but do not expect but to see another game without Couturier just reminds me of last year's first ","summary":"I didn't expect #flyers to go deep this year. I hope but do not expect but to see another game without Couturier just reminds me of last year's first round ejection. 3-1. Can we do this? We have done it 3-0 against Bruins. ...Need Couturier or we might as well just give away the PP goals.","date":"2018-04-19","published":"2018-04-19T14:02:46+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"tags":["flyers"],"access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published"}
