{"id":"known:e88a014c0f801617083a0951144ada74","url":"/archive/known/?id=e88a014c0f801617083a0951144ada74","source":"known","type":"notes","title":"A lot of talk at #oer18 about missing southern voices. Maybe one way to increase involvement would be to offer #oer19 or #oer20 in a southern hemisphe","summary":"A lot of talk at #oer18 about missing southern voices. Maybe one way to increase involvement would be to offer #oer19 or #oer20 in a southern hemisphere nation?","date":"2018-04-19","published":"2018-04-19T12:23:13+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"tags":["oer18","oer19","oer20"],"access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published"}
{"id":"known:d6e8896a767890820d39cd9f5f2d97c6","url":"/archive/known/?id=d6e8896a767890820d39cd9f5f2d97c6","source":"known","type":"replies","title":"@palan57 @jennbinis But interoperability can be easy if industry agree to open protocols, standards and metadata. Plus this protects kids as it will b","summary":"@palan57 @jennbinis But interoperability can be easy if industry agree to open protocols, standards and metadata. Plus this protects kids as it will be APIs touching APIs rather than having to share databases. Finally it will allow researches and public access to anonymized data rather than just letting edtech vendors hoarde data.","date":"2018-04-19","published":"2018-04-19T12:19:11+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/palan57/status/986941300107866112","tags":[],"access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published"}
{"id":"known:9c29fbe22bd78f430f37dcf31f09b436","url":"/archive/known/?id=9c29fbe22bd78f430f37dcf31f09b436","source":"known","type":"notes","title":"Interoperability does have a legacy cost but if we put effort into our metadata and standards tools can be built like the oer commons resource builder","summary":"Interoperability does have a legacy cost but if we put effort into our metadata and standards tools can be built like the oer commons resource builder and Google Docs importer to make easier on everyday people. We can get there I am commenting on the #oer18 feed from my own website using #indieweb tools. I get to own my data and decide where to share it.","date":"2018-04-19","published":"2018-04-19T12:14:04+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"tags":["indieweb","oer18"],"access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published"}
