{"id":"known:e258bbfa1c50626194ba6b3afac37196","url":"/archive/known/?id=e258bbfa1c50626194ba6b3afac37196","source":"known","type":"notes","title":"Why do we need a platform at all? Ca't we use our own websites, #oer markup, and a variety of tools like rss or #indieweb tools while connecting every","summary":"Why do we need a platform at all? Ca't we use our own websites, #oer markup, and a variety of tools like rss or #indieweb tools while connecting everyone together without the need of any centralized repository? #oer18","date":"2018-04-19","published":"2018-04-19T11:50:45+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"tags":["indieweb","oer","oer18"],"access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published"}
