{"id":"known:665d172726fbf52be01c9a8022ef5fe0","url":"/archive/known/?id=665d172726fbf52be01c9a8022ef5fe0","source":"known","type":"replies","title":"@DimitrisTzouris But in education spaces I find I often have to build in \"open practices\" on proprietary colosed software like Google Suite for Educat","summary":"@DimitrisTzouris But in education spaces I find I often have to build in \"open practices\" on proprietary colosed software like Google Suite for Educations before getting folks to \"open technologies\" #oer18","date":"2018-04-19","published":"2018-04-19T11:17:50+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/DimitrisTzouris/status/986925991309258752","tags":["oer18"],"access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published"}
