{"id":"known:f6384c8977823a0b52153a17035bde00","url":"/archive/known/?id=f6384c8977823a0b52153a17035bde00","source":"known","type":"notes","title":"This looks like an interesting approach I could take to try and finalize the #indieweb migration of my courses. But I want to try and do it on my own.","summary":"This looks like an interesting approach I could take to try and finalize the #indieweb migration of my courses. But I want to try and do it on my own. I should be able to mark up the html of a learning html and then use the classes to render it differently on my syllabus website and class website.","date":"2018-04-17","published":"2018-04-17T10:41:59+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/_Ritual/status/986154907228098560?s=19","tags":["indieweb"],"access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published"}
