{"id":"known:9b4d3c2a397c1e411675e5ef03bf945b","url":"/archive/known/?id=9b4d3c2a397c1e411675e5ef03bf945b","source":"known","type":"notes","title":"I keep hearing about this survey of teen iPhone use all over the tech press..and I don't believe it. I don't believe any any survey until I read the m","summary":"I keep hearing about this survey of teen iPhone use all over the tech press..and I don't believe it. I don't believe any any survey until I read the methodology but this is off. Not sure 84% of US teens own a smart phone. That seems high. Furthermore the students I work with are mainly Android. They may want an iPhone but the can't afford it.","date":"2018-04-16","published":"2018-04-16T21:28:17+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"http://www.businessinsider.com/apple-iphone-popularity-teens-piper-jaffray-2018-4","tags":[],"access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published"}
{"id":"known:e78ac01ad861b1bacd32716a3d6d75c8","url":"/archive/known/?id=e78ac01ad861b1bacd32716a3d6d75c8","source":"known","type":"notes","title":"I wont be in a place to pay my LRA dues until I teach some summer classes. If folks see any interesting #literacies or #lra18 emails on listserv pleas","summary":"I wont be in a place to pay my LRA dues until I teach some summer classes. If folks see any interesting #literacies or #lra18 emails on listserv please forward to me. I still argue LRA should move to a \"member recruitment\" model and not a \"member benefit\" model. We should allow everyone to see listserv.","date":"2018-04-16","published":"2018-04-16T17:45:31+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"tags":["literacies","lra18"],"access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published"}
{"id":"known:a2eed019f0ec161b30f35f4b6b4828c2","url":"/archive/known/?id=a2eed019f0ec161b30f35f4b6b4828c2","source":"known","type":"replies","title":"The same is true for the skills employers are so desperate to develop at #ASUGSV2018. The most common I here, \"Your kids can't use Excel.\" I also hear","summary":"The same is true for the skills employers are so desperate to develop at #ASUGSV2018. The most common I here, \"Your kids can't use Excel.\" I also heard that back when they yelled at us n middle school for not knowing Lotus Notes. Really that's my job? To teach spreadsheets? That's what you want students speding 50k a year on? I can teach a student to read yo","date":"2018-04-16","published":"2018-04-16T16:11:01+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/985912682728607745","tags":["ASUGSV2018"],"access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published"}
{"id":"known:1e2ef642d5ae0231d8696c5ba18d614f","url":"/archive/known/?id=1e2ef642d5ae0231d8696c5ba18d614f","source":"known","type":"notes","title":"I wish all this talk about CBE and skills at #ASUSGSV2918 would take a lesson from 30 years of reading research and realize teaching skills does littl","summary":"I wish all this talk about CBE and skills at #ASUSGSV2918 would take a lesson from 30 years of reading research and realize teaching skills does little without knowledge. We know we can teach decoding that's easy. Doesn't make a better reader alone.","date":"2018-04-16","published":"2018-04-16T16:03:01+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"tags":["ASUSGSV2918"],"access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published"}
