{"id":"known:8740d08eb38cea7cb0e53f8e2b37ff75","url":"/archive/known/?id=8740d08eb38cea7cb0e53f8e2b37ff75","source":"known","type":"notes","title":"Interesting the static versus dynamic debate was always a fun cultural tension to watch between @mozilla foundation and @mozilla Corporation. MoFo alw","summary":"Interesting the static versus dynamic debate was always a fun cultural tension to watch between @mozilla foundation and @mozilla Corporation. MoFo always wanted the latest and greatest in dynamic sites for public facing pages and MoCo was always like, \"You know we can just do that in 63 lines of HTML.\"","date":"2018-04-13","published":"2018-04-13T14:36:38+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"tags":[],"access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published"}
