{"id":"known:e88e9bfdc74c0840a8aa02246178bcb5","url":"/archive/known/?id=e88e9bfdc74c0840a8aa02246178bcb5","source":"known","type":"replies","title":"@kevinmarks Love that metaphor? Making them all predators to boot is a little loaded (we can avoid the salt water vs river fish for a bit). What does ","summary":"@kevinmarks Love that metaphor? Making them all predators to boot is a little loaded (we can avoid the salt water vs river fish for a bit). What does it mean when the pirhana needs the white shark for sign on and advertising? And does this make the #indieweb a dolphin which can do some damage to sharks?","date":"2018-04-13","published":"2018-04-13T00:00:09+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/kevinmarks/status/984495879397797889","tags":["indieweb"],"access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published"}
