{"id":"known:392b9c203a4f9ce0f94d3c95468949ba","url":"/archive/known/?id=392b9c203a4f9ce0f94d3c95468949ba","source":"known","type":"articles","title":"#Indieweb and Business","summary":"We had a discussion on the Indieweb chat that sparked a lot of thoughts. Rather than continuing to spam the channels I decided to share my thoughts here. I think overall an indieweb approach actually requires rethinking of ownership models and a co-op that includes a suite of tools and services. The REI of Micropubs. People then bring these tools to their co","date":"2018-04-05","published":"2018-04-05T02:05:27+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"tags":["indieweb"],"access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published"}
{"id":"known:bc3e7e26ef3ddd1fe3d04406c8c211b0","url":"/archive/known/?id=bc3e7e26ef3ddd1fe3d04406c8c211b0","source":"known","type":"articles","title":"Call it What it is-- Murder","summary":"We need to call it murder. You take donations from the NRA you profit from murder. You submit NRA membership dues you pay for murder. We need to make this a battle cry from now until November and encourage our responsible gun owning neighbors to reject the NRA and their complicity in murder.","date":"2018-02-16","published":"2018-02-16T00:09:40+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"tags":["1d2129"],"access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published"}
{"id":"known:557ec3adbe46ccee893d01c530059677","url":"/archive/known/?id=557ec3adbe46ccee893d01c530059677","source":"known","type":"articles","title":"I am done with thoughts and prayers.","summary":"Don't tell me it's to soon to be political. It's too late. Don't tell me it's time for thoughts and prayers. It's time for action. How many more? How many more? Don't talk to me about mental health issues. The kind of massive mental health care our nation needs requires a single payer system. You won't even mandate insurance. Yes these crazed men need counse","date":"2018-02-15","published":"2018-02-15T01:30:01+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"tags":[],"access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published"}
