{"id":"known:18f023db331513f468c1099ef4a54eb9","url":"/archive/known/?id=18f023db331513f468c1099ef4a54eb9","source":"known","type":"photos","title":"Where does Self Begin if at all?","summary":"So I am back to working on Chapter IV of our book on Open Pedagogy and it is really taking me on a journey into where self, identity and the collective begin. From Kaku, Gee, Kant, Hume, and Bhudda really covering it all....and trying to get it done in fewest paragraphs possible. We are distinguishing from the self and consciousness from Me(s) and identity w","date":"2017-06-26","published":"2017-06-26T14:30:04+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"tags":[],"access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published"}
