{"id":"known:51489105b96cb273c8a69e857132bf3d","url":"/archive/known/?id=51489105b96cb273c8a69e857132bf3d","source":"known","type":"articles","title":"Recognizing Many Networks Loosely Joined at #MozAloha","summary":"Yesterday I got the chance to catch up with the Participation Team as we continue our development of the Leadership Toolkit . Everyone is off at all-hands in Hawaii. I joined remotely from Connecticut to hack away at some work. It was great to catch up with Mikko, Verena, and Emma. When it comes to developing resources for open pedagogy on a global scale I c","date":"2016-12-08","published":"2016-12-08T14:46:05+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"tags":[],"access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published"}
