{"id":"known:746ee79e7f17cd6eadb41777a614ab54","url":"/archive/known/?id=746ee79e7f17cd6eadb41777a614ab54","source":"known","type":"articles","title":"Meet the candidates East Haddam BOE","summary":"Eric Anderson up first. Has teaching background. MA from UCONN and 6th SCSU. Has three goals 1. Responsible budget that passes first time. Wants transparency. 2. Wants to concentrate on high school accreditation. He has done it before. 3. Embrace identity has small school district. We can't provide what large districts provide.","date":"2015-10-20","published":"2015-10-20T23:10:08+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"tags":[],"access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published"}
