{"id":"known:2405df73ace2b922f5541c29f4ae3205","url":"/archive/known/?id=2405df73ace2b922f5541c29f4ae3205","source":"known","type":"articles","title":"Pedagogical Affordances and Instructional Design Using @withknown","summary":"I recieved a question from a teacher at Northwest Catholic High School . I am helping the school launch a 1:1 iPad initiative . As part of the workflow teachers can set up a classroom website using Known ,an open source learning platform designed for educators. We do not yet use a Known Campus licesened site yet. During the pilot year teachers are building t","date":"2015-08-17","published":"2015-08-17T15:40:25+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"tags":[],"access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published"}
