{"id":"known:ad3cf67c04b35a84d2afda36e2551015","url":"/archive/known/?id=ad3cf67c04b35a84d2afda36e2551015","source":"known","type":"replies","title":"Was worried that my online class Language Arts: A Development Approach did not cover enough on the topic of writing instruction in #digped. There were","summary":"Was worried that my online class Language Arts: A Development Approach did not cover enough on the topic of writing instruction in #digped. There were a variety of reasons: -The 13 week online class had to be completed in 3 weeks. This meant material had to go. -There are pre-service and certified teachers in the class. Elementary certification in CT require","date":"2015-08-12","published":"2015-08-12T19:58:46+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"http://networkedlearningcollaborative.com/the-courses/language-arts-a-developmental-approach/","tags":[],"access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published"}
{"id":"known:0a48105e450f56b91c640126f9c9981c","url":"/archive/known/?id=0a48105e450f56b91c640126f9c9981c","source":"known","type":"articles","title":"Me and The Search Bubble #digped","summary":"@jgmac1106 @heatherwalder Incognito doesn’t filter out IP address influences, right? Does DDG? (I’ve never considered this.) #digped — Chris Friend (@chris_friend) August 12, 2015 As part of #digped folks were Googling themselves. I discussed how search results are now curated and influenced by those we follow, where we are, and what we have searched for in ","date":"2015-08-12","published":"2015-08-12T16:50:06+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"tags":[],"access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published"}
