{"id":"known:0bf9cc72113d756ac57e1ae120010483","url":"/archive/known/?id=0bf9cc72113d756ac57e1ae120010483","source":"known","type":"notes","title":"@erinkelly12 @JimKellyInc Two heroes I wish I never had. So thankful for @HuntersHopeFDN for their support of CHOP in the fight against Leukodystrophi","summary":"@erinkelly12 @JimKellyInc Two heroes I wish I never had. So thankful for @HuntersHopeFDN for their support of CHOP in the fight against Leukodystrophies. The CHOP family made an impossible but inevitable journey a walk amongst courage, knowledge, hope, tears, goodbyes, and beginnings. Much love to my brother Bobby, hit wife Constanza and of course Baby Bobby","date":"2015-05-21","published":"2015-05-21T03:33:31+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"http://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/the-childrens-hospital-of-philadelphia-to-launch-leukodystrophy-center-of-excellence-for-children-with-degenerative-inherited-white-matter-diseases-300085108.html","tags":[],"access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published"}
