{"id":"known:4e2a110a253cc8031add1aaab3f4252b","url":"/archive/known/?id=4e2a110a253cc8031add1aaab3f4252b","source":"known","type":"articles","title":"Memes in Education #neisdpln","summary":"So you want to learn the secret sauce of using memes in education? What makes ideas spreadable? How can you use memes in the classroom for literary analysis? How do we do it, inspire others, and not go crazy? How do we keep kids sharing safe content. There is art to it all. Using memes is more than just throwing a quote on a pic. It is multimodal composition","date":"2015-04-21","published":"2015-04-21T22:12:31+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"tags":[],"access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published"}
{"id":"known:c002893204bb6feba120930bbbabc881","url":"/archive/known/?id=c002893204bb6feba120930bbbabc881","source":"known","type":"notes","title":"As Common Core testing enters second week, controversy still abounds - WRGB CBS6 - Top Stories http://www.cbs6albany.com/news/features/top-story/stori","summary":"As Common Core testing enters second week, controversy still abounds - WRGB CBS6 - Top Stories http://www.cbs6albany.com/news/features/top-story/stories/as-common-core-testing-enters-second-week-controversy-still-abounds-24810.shtml If you can generate valid and reliable scores by sampling methods Why are we wasting billions testing every child.","date":"2015-04-21","published":"2015-04-21T00:49:42+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"tags":[],"access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published"}
{"id":"known:5389fa25407b8909b7fa2af4e8894d2e","url":"/archive/known/?id=5389fa25407b8909b7fa2af4e8894d2e","source":"known","type":"notes","title":"@mtechman Melissa and I were discussing #AERA15 and how awesome it is when conferences have wifi. The cost of providing wifi is astronomical but essen","summary":"@mtechman Melissa and I were discussing #AERA15 and how awesome it is when conferences have wifi. The cost of providing wifi is astronomical but essential. She brought up the idea of the edcamp unconference model. That got me thinking how could we do a #literacies unconference. If there were enough folks interested I would be more than happy to help organize","date":"2015-04-19","published":"2015-04-19T14:01:23+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/mtechman/status/589767847993303040","tags":[],"access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published"}
