{"id":"known:72749e3a727d249e0aef6798c9bdae36","url":"/archive/known/?id=72749e3a727d249e0aef6798c9bdae36","source":"known","type":"articles","title":"Trying to Master Sections and Learning how to make single page wesbites #Teachtheweb","summary":"I don't know the history of modern design but it fascinates me. It is as if Design is becoming more of a standard rather than a trend. The rise of minimal, flat, material (not sure what its called) design happened so fast. I don't know what drove it. Was it Apple turning away from skeumorphic design; Medium ushering in an era of large header images, line spa","date":"2015-03-22","published":"2015-03-22T15:06:33+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"tags":[],"access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published"}
