{"id":"twitter:2005816125494345752","tweet_id":"2005816125494345752","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2005816125494345752","title":"You can disagree with Affordable Care Act, but you can't just make things up. Premiums were rising by 93% annually before the ACA, and around 67% afte","summary":"You can disagree with Affordable Care Act, but you can't just make things up. Premiums were rising by 93% annually before the ACA, and around 67% after. Had red states not rejected expanded Medicare and courts not tossed the Individual Mandate Millions more would be enrolled https://x.com/RepTiffany/status/2005802490298802362","date":"2025-12-30","published":"2025-12-30T01:40:05+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>You can disagree with  Affordable Care Act, but you can&#x27;t just make things up.<br><br>Premiums were rising by 93% annually before the ACA, and around 67% after.<br><br>Had red states not rejected expanded Medicare and courts not tossed the Individual Mandate<br><br>Millions more would be enrolled <a href=\"https://x.com/RepTiffany/status/2005802490298802362\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/RepTiffany/status/2005802490298802362</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2005816125494345752","display_date":"December 30, 2025 · 01:40 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
