{"id":"twitter:2005759807773724891","tweet_id":"2005759807773724891","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2005759807773724891","title":"In 2008 Epstein's planes were listed as \"Signatory Visa Waiver Program Carries\". Epstein was allowed to transport citizens from designated countries w","summary":"In 2008 Epstein's planes were listed as \"Signatory Visa Waiver Program Carries\". Epstein was allowed to transport citizens from designated countries without them having to obtain a visa for up to 90 days It's how the victims got smuggled into the country h/t @mudpuppy_16 https://t.co/LHh9lYuUUu","date":"2025-12-29","published":"2025-12-29T21:56:18+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>In 2008  Epstein&#x27;s planes were listed as &quot;Signatory Visa Waiver Program Carries&quot;. <br><br>Epstein  was allowed to transport citizens from designated countries without them having to obtain a visa for up to 90 days<br><br>It&#x27;s how the victims got smuggled into the country<br><br>h/t @mudpuppy_16 <a href=\"https://t.co/LHh9lYuUUu\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/LHh9lYuUUu</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/dcb3901fadf900bd1fc914e1d269b22c.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2005759807773724891","display_date":"December 29, 2025 · 21:56 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/dcb3901fadf900bd1fc914e1d269b22c.jpg"]}
