{"id":"twitter:2003604875184165333","tweet_id":"2003604875184165333","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2003604875184165333","title":"So Timeline goes: DOJ releases tweet saying in next data dump some info may not be truthful. DOJ releases files Influencers and grifter elevate the fa","summary":"So Timeline goes: DOJ releases tweet saying in next data dump some info may not be truthful. DOJ releases files Influencers and grifter elevate the fake tips and forgeries. Few hours later DOJ concludes an investigation proving forgeries are fake. We are supposed to buy it.","date":"2025-12-23","published":"2025-12-23T23:13:22+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>So Timeline goes: DOJ releases tweet saying in next data dump some info may not be truthful.<br><br>DOJ releases files<br><br>Influencers and grifter elevate the fake tips and forgeries.<br><br>Few hours later DOJ concludes an investigation proving forgeries are fake.<br><br>We are supposed to buy it.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2003604875184165333","display_date":"December 23, 2025 · 23:13 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
